[
  {"comment": "A rib's and a web's Draft Angle (mitcad#2102, GitHub mitcad/Mitcad#488): the sides lean so that the wall is thicker where it meets the body, its thickness measured at the curves. A 60 x 40 x 10 base (Sketch1 F1, Extrude1 F2, Body1 F2.b0): 24000 mm3."},
  {"cmd": "sketch.create"},
  {"cmd": "sketch.add_rectangle", "sketch": "F1", "corner": [0, 0], "width": 60, "height": 40},
  {"cmd": "add_feature", "def": {"type": "extrude",
    "profiles": [{"sketch": "F1", "region": "r{c1[c4,c2],c2[c1,c3],c3[c2,c4],c4[c3,c1]}"}],
    "extent": {"type": "distance", "distance": 10}, "operation": "new_body"}},
  {"expect": {"body": "F2.b0", "volume": 24000, "tolerance": 1e-9}},

  {"comment": "On the plane y = 20 (Plane1 F3 from XZ, whose normal is +Y and sketch y -Z; Sketch2 F4) the line at z = 30 from x = 10 to 50, a rib 4 thick (Rib1, F5) grown down (at right angles to the line, to its left) to the base's top, 20 below, drafted 2 degrees: 4 thick at the line and 4 + 40 tan 2 deg at the base, 800 (4 + 20 tan 2 deg) more."},
  {"cmd": "add_feature", "def": {"type": "construction_plane", "definition": {"type": "offset", "plane": "xz", "distance": 20}}},
  {"cmd": "sketch.create", "plane": "F3"},
  {"cmd": "sketch.add_line", "sketch": "F4", "start": [10, -30], "end": [50, -30]},
  {"cmd": "add_feature", "def": {"type": "rib", "curves": {"sketch": "F4", "curves": ["c1"]}, "thickness": 4,
    "extent": {"type": "to_next"}, "draft_angle": "2 deg"}},
  {"expect": {"feature": "Rib1", "status": "ok", "bodies": 1, "body": "F2.b0", "volume": 27758.732311867963,
    "tolerance": 1e-6, "has_face": "F5:wall1"}},
  {"expect": {"body": "F2.b0", "has_face": "F5:side(c1)"}},

  {"comment": "The angle edited to 1 degree: 800 (4 + 20 tan 1 deg) more than the base."},
  {"cmd": "edit_feature", "uid": "F5", "def": {"type": "rib", "curves": {"sketch": "F4", "curves": ["c1"]},
    "thickness": 4, "extent": {"type": "to_next"}, "draft_angle": "1 deg"}},
  {"expect": {"feature": "Rib1", "status": "ok", "bodies": 1, "body": "F2.b0", "volume": 27479.28103885148,
    "tolerance": 1e-6}},

  {"comment": "Two of them 10 apart along Y (RectangularPattern1, F6, Adjust): the copy at y = 30 is built again where it lands, drafted as the original."},
  {"cmd": "add_feature", "def": {"type": "rectangular_pattern",
    "objects": {"type": "features", "features": ["F5"]},
    "direction1": {"axis": {"type": "origin", "axis": "y"}, "quantity": 2, "distance": 10},
    "distance_type": "spacing"}},
  {"expect": {"feature": "RectangularPattern1", "status": "ok", "bodies": 1, "body": "F2.b0",
    "volume": 30958.56207770296, "tolerance": 1e-6, "has_face": "F6:inst1(F5:wall1)"}},

  {"comment": "A web on the base's top (Plane2 F7 at z = 10, Sketch3 F8), the line y = 5 from x = 10 to 50, 2 thick and 8 deep (Web1, F9), drafted 1.5 degrees: its curve lies on the base, so it narrows as it grows, 2 - 16 tan 1.5 deg thick at its top: 320 (2 - 8 tan 1.5 deg) more."},
  {"cmd": "add_feature", "def": {"type": "construction_plane", "definition": {"type": "offset", "plane": "xy", "distance": 10}}},
  {"cmd": "sketch.create", "plane": "F7"},
  {"cmd": "sketch.add_line", "sketch": "F8", "start": [10, 5], "end": [50, 5]},
  {"cmd": "add_feature", "def": {"type": "web", "curves": {"sketch": "F8", "curves": ["c1"]}, "thickness": 2,
    "extent": {"type": "depth", "depth": 8}, "draft_angle": "1.5 deg"}},
  {"expect": {"feature": "Web1", "status": "ok", "bodies": 1, "body": "F2.b0", "volume": 31531.526118485843,
    "tolerance": 1e-6, "has_face": "F9:wall1(c1)"}},

  {"comment": "Edited to no draft: a plain wall, 640 more."},
  {"cmd": "edit_feature", "uid": "F9", "def": {"type": "web", "curves": {"sketch": "F8", "curves": ["c1"]},
    "thickness": 2, "extent": {"type": "depth", "depth": 8}}},
  {"expect": {"feature": "Web1", "status": "ok", "bodies": 1, "body": "F2.b0", "volume": 31598.56207770296,
    "tolerance": 1e-6}},

  {"comment": "A draft that closes the web before its depth fails in words: at 10 degrees the sides of a wall 2 thick meet 5.67 above the base."},
  {"cmd": "edit_feature", "uid": "F9", "def": {"type": "web", "curves": {"sketch": "F8", "curves": ["c1"]},
    "thickness": 2, "extent": {"type": "depth", "depth": 8}, "draft_angle": "10 deg"}},
  {"expect": {"feature": "Web1", "status": "error", "error_contains": "the draft angle closes the web"}}
]
